 "strings": [
  "",
  "Garma, North American chief, died.",
  "When news of his death arrived,",
  "Zeon's Sovereign Degwin",
  "is said to have dropped his cane.",
  "The death of the youngest son,",
  "dear to him, born late in life,",
  "was a shock, it seems, even to",
  "this man,",
  "who had built a nation in space",
  "in a single generation.",
  "Nor did the matter end there.",
  "As Char's first step to revenge,",
  "and as the outcome of Amuro",
  "and the others' desperate fight",
  "to survive,",
  "Garma's death",
  "would come to have many effects",
  "far and wide.",
  "Of course the Federation rejoiced.",
  "For a Federation that had known",
  "only losses and stalemates,",
  "Garma's death",
  "was an event to be",
  "trumpeted far and wide.",
  "It was in the propaganda war, then,",
  "that the Federation first launched",
  "a full-scale counteroffensive.",
  "The \"spatial fortress\" strategy,",
  "using vast space itself--",
  "the Earth's own land--",
  "to retreat over and over,",
  "making the enemy stretch its lines",
  "until it wore itself out,",
  "was sound as strategy, but",
  "the people left behind",
  "were enraged.",
  "Now,",
  "to draw the drifting hearts",
  "of the people back once more,",
  "trumpeting this victory",
  "was vital.",
  "Zeon, on the other hand,",
  "was plunged at once into hardship.",
  "Since ancient times,",
  "the death of a good general",
  "has often brought a nation low;",
  "and Zeon had lost a man who,",
  "soldier or not, as a governor",
  "had a truly outstanding talent:",
  "a man with a delicate touch,",
  "popular in occupied lands.",
  "With Garma dead, and it plain",
  "that whoever filled his seat,",
  "things would never be",
  "as they were in Garma's day,",
  "Zeon began losing public support.",
  "Losing the people's support,",
  "guerrilla activity grew fiercer;",
  "as it grew fiercer,",
  "Zeon cracked down by force,",
  "and the crackdowns",
  "bred fresh hatred:",
  "a vicious cycle had begun.",
  "Portrait of the Zabi Family",
  "Char's Demotion",
  "Zeon's Sovereign Degwin Zabi, his",
  "youngest son lost, was shattered.",
  "But even that was denied him;",
  "soon he would be drawn into",
  "a Zabi family council--that is,",
  "the supreme council of Zeon.",
  "The agenda was",
  "a counter-propaganda campaign",
  "against the Federation's.",
  "Even Degwin's son's death",
  "was about to be used in politics.",
  "Gihren",
  "\"We cannot let Garma's death",
  " go to waste.",
  " The Zabi name itself is at stake.\"",
  "Degwin",
  "\"Gihren, all I want for Garma...\"",
  "Honor Guard",
  "\"Begging your pardon.\"",
  "\"Lord Dozle Zabi",
  " and Lady Kycilia Zabi have just",
  " arrived from the front.\"",
  "\"Show them in.\"",
  "Dozle",
  "\"Father!!\"",
  "\"You came quickly, both of you.\"",
  "\"Father, you must be...\"",
  "Kycilia",
  "\"It is regrettable.",
  " That Garma, of all people, should",
  " fall to a Federation mobile suit.\"",
  "\"B-Brother, I still can't believe it.",
  " I keep thinking he'll",
  " show his face any moment.\"",
  "\"Dwelling on the past",
  " won't win the war, Dozle.\"",
  "\"But I thought that he",
  " would become a general",
  " who could command even me.\"",
  "\"I was looking forward to it...\"",
  "\"Dozle is right.\"",
  "\"That is why, Gihren--",
  " won't you quietly, respectfully",
  " pray for Garma's soul?\"",
  "\"With respect, Father.\"",
  "\"Why is it wrong for our house",
  " alone to mourn Garma's death?\"",
  "\"Father, we are at war.",
  " To further ensure",
  " the people's fighting spirit...\"",
  "\"...a nationwide state funeral",
  " would surely be most fitting.\"",
  "\"Garma's death",
  " is not Garma's alone. It belongs",
  " to the Principality of Zeon.\"",
  "\"I agree with Gihren.\"",
  "\"No, more pressing",
  " is Char's punishment.\"",
  "\"Punish the one who failed",
  " to protect Garma,",
  " and that will set the example.\"",
  "\"Such matters you may handle",
  " under your own authority.\"",
  "\"What matters is the ceremony,",
  " Father.\"",
  "\"Garma was very popular",
  " with the people.\"",
  "\"By holding his state funeral, their",
  " hatred of the Earth Federation...\"",
  "\"is what we must stir up,",
  " is it not?",
  "\"As for Char, Dozle,",
  " see that he is demoted...\"",
  "\"Father,",
  " as Sovereign of the Principality",
  " of Zeon, decide here and now.\"",
  "In terms of historical fact alone,",
  "Degwin, just as Gihren said,",
  "would hold a grand funeral",
  "for Garma.",
  "And Degwin",
  "did not weep.",
  "But toward his eldest son,",
