  "By killing Garma, Char had achieved",
  "the first stage of his revenge.",
  "Whether that was good or bad,",
  "no one can say.",
  "By order of his superior Dozle,",
  "for failing to protect Garma,",
  "Char was confined to quarters.",
  "In the end,",
  "he would likely be demoted.",
  "That he wasn't jailed for murder",
  "was something to be glad of,",
  "but for an elite like Char,",
  "this was a major black mark.",
  "Char was a man of love.",
  "And Garma had been",
  "his classmate at the academy.",
  "Char had his revenge,",
  "but his heart was hardly at peace.",
  "Against Garma himself he bore",
  "no grudge, save his being a Zabi.",
  "So Char, feeling something",
  "rather sour in his heart,",
  "shed his uniform",
  "and passed his days drinking.",
  "Of course, all the while,",
  "between Zeon and the Federation",
  "the war went on.",
  "The Mexico Line.",
  "That was the name",
  "of the Federation's defense line.",
  "With North America's east and west",
  "lost, the defense line was little",
  "more than the few troops inland",
  "and Mexico, the gateway joining",
  "those wilds to South America.",
  "Now Zeon's largest",
  "logistics base on Earth,",
  "California Base",
  "lay close by;",
  "roughly along",
  "the Mexican border,",
  "the two armies faced off.",
  "Defense, three to one.",
  "This rule, as old as war itself,",
  "made for a situation where",
  "whoever attacked, lost.",
  "This froze the front lines",
  "and decided the state",
  "of the American front.",
  "On that day,",
  "Garma Zabi's funeral was held.",
  "It is said to have been grand,",
  "drawing in the entire nation.",
  "\"We have lost a hero.\"",
  "\"But",
  " does this mean defeat?\"",
  "\"No! It is the beginning!\"",
  "\"Next to the Earth Federation,",
  " the national strength of our Zeon",
  " is less than one-thirtieth.\"",
  "\"Nevertheless,",
  " how is it that we have been able",
  " to fight on to this day?\"",
  "\"Citizens,",
  " it is because the war aims",
  " of our Zeon are just!\"",
  "Aboard the White Base",
  "Amuro",
  "\"What's going on,",
  " Bright-san?",
  " Picking up a civilian broadcast?\"",
  "Bright",
  "\"Zeon's rubbing it in, airing it",
  " live all over the world.",
  " You'd better watch too, Amuro.\"",
  "\"Y-yes, sir.\"",
  "\"A handful of elites has ruled",
  " the Earth Federation, swollen",
  " into space, for fifty-some years!\"",
  "\"We who live in space",
  " demanded our freedom...\"",
  "\"Remember how many times",
  " the Federation trampled us!\"",
  "\"God will never forsake the fight",
  " Zeon wages for the freedom",
  " of every single human being!\"",
  "\"My brother, whom you all loved,",
  " Garma Zabi, is dead.\"",
  "\"Why?\"",
  "Someone else was hearing",
  "the same broadcast, in a bar.",
  "It was Char, whose demotion",
  "had been decided the day before.",
  "Char",
  "\"Because he was just a boy.\"",
  "\"The fighting has eased a little.\"",
  "\"Are you not",
  " looking on this war",
  " as a fire on a distant shore?\"",
  "\"But that",
  " is a grievous error!\"",
  "\"The Earth Federation would live",
  " by defiling the one sacred Earth!\"",
  "\"We must teach the elites",
  " of the Earth Federation",
  " the folly of it!\"",
  "\"Garma",
  " died to awaken you",
  " from your naive thinking!\"",
  "\"The battle begins now!\"",
  "\"Our armaments",
  " grow ever stronger.\"",
  "\"Nor will the Earth Federation",
  " Forces stay as they are.\"",
  "\"Your fathers, your brothers,",
  " died before the Federation's",
  " thoughtless resistance!\"",
  "\"This sorrow, this anger,",
  " we must never forget!\"",
  "\"Garma has shown us this",
  " through his death!\"",
  "\"Only by gathering this anger now",
  " and hurling it at the Federation",
  " can we win true victory!\"",
  "\"This victory will be the greatest",
  " solace for all our war dead!\"",
  "\"Rise up, my people!!\"",
  "\"Turn your sorrow into anger,",
  " and rise up, my people!!\"",
  "\"Zeon needs",
  " your strength!\"",
  "\"Sieg Zeon!!!\"",
  "In the bar, Char",
  "rose to his feet, his face blank.",
  "Though in plain clothes,",
  "a man who could only be a soldier",
  "was drawing near.",
  "\"Bartender, the check.\"",
  "Man",
  "\"Allow me to treat you to that.",
  " Would that be all right?\"",
  "\"You're with the Royal Guard?\"",
  "\"You can tell?\"",
  "\"It's the smell.",
  " One of Kycilia's people?\"",
  "\"Ha ha! Most astute, Commander.\"",
  "(Revenge as his sister? Or...)",
  "Zeon Citizens",
  "\"Sieg Zeon!\"",
  "\"What nonsense.",
  " Listen to him, a man who plots",
  " a Zabi family dictatorship!\"",
  "\"Dictatorship?\"",
  "\"Zeon is ruled",
  " by the Zabi family.",
  " A mere handful of royals.\"",
  "\"I see... so that's it.",
  " This is the enemy.\"",
  "Amuro's thoughts, as he watched,",
  "were nothing like Bright's words.",
  "Amuro, learning for the first time",
  "that the enemy preached justice,",
  "mourned the dead, and was human,",
  "stared at the screen as if dazed.",
  "Next to the enemy he had imagined,",
  "it was far more ordinary.",
  "Like a family mourning a slain son."
